          <p class="timeline__desc">Isi formulir dan unggah berkas melalui portal.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="timeline__item">
          <time class="timeline__date" datetime="2027-02-01">1 – 20 Feb 2027</time>
          <h3 class="timeline__title">Seleksi berkas</h3>
          <p class="timeline__desc">Verifikasi dokumen dan penilaian esai.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="timeline__item">
          <time class="timeline__date" datetime="2027-03-01">1 – 20 Mar 2027</time>
          <h3 class="timeline__title">Wawancara</h3>
          <p class="timeline__desc">Sesi 30 menit dengan dua pewawancara.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="timeline__item">
          <time class="timeline__date" datetime="2027-03-31">31 Mar 2027</time>
          <h3 class="timeline__title">Pengumuman</h3>
          <p class="timeline__desc">Hasil dikirim via email dan portal.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="timeline__item">
          <time class="timeline__date" datetime="2027-04-10">10 – 12 Apr 2027</time>
          <h3 class="timeline__title">Orientasi</h3>
          <p class="timeline__desc">Pertemuan perdana penerima dan mentor.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
